l":2,"wikitext":"Miss Thorpe attacked [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] to retrieve the [[Eathon's journal]]. She invoked a [[Redcap]] but was defeated when Lok hit her on the head with a stick outside of [[Dante Vale's house]]. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nShe guarded the Organization safehouse on the [[Road of Alchemists]]. She was then, however, knocked out by [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]]. {{Source|Chasing Void}}","text":"Miss Thorpe attacked Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill to retrieve the Eathon's journal. She invoked a Redcap but was defeated when Lok hit her on the head with a stick outside of Dante Vale's house. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nShe guarded the Organization safehouse on the Road of Alchemists. She was then, however, knocked out by Powerbonded Sabriel. [Chasing Void]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, Thorpe was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, Thorpe was issued with the standard Organization Titans."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":2,"wikitext":"*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Boltflare]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n*[[Hyperstride]]\n\n{{Col-2}}","text":"*Augerfrost\n*Boltflare\n*Raypulse\n*Hyperstride"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":2,"wikitext":"*[[Mindrone]]\n*[[Redcap]]\n*[[Strix]]\n{{Col-end}}","text":"*Mindrone\n*Redcap\n*Strix"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"<gallery position=\"center\">\nMs. Thorpe.png\nMs. Thorpe.jpg\nS1E02 Thorpe invokes Mindrone.png|Ms. Thorpe invokes [[Mindrone]]\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"Ms. Thorpe.png\nMs. Thorpe.jpg\nS1E02 Thorpe invokes Mindrone.png|Ms. Thorpe invokes Mindrone"}],"full_text":"Miss Thorpe is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by DeFoe. She is one of the group's operatives working out of Venice, Italy.\n\n== History ==\nMiss Thorpe attacked Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill to retrieve the Eathon's journal. She invoked a Redcap but was defeated when Lok hit her on the head with a stick outside of Dante Vale's house. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nShe guarded the Organization safehouse on the Road of Alchemists. She was then, however, knocked out by Powerbonded Sabriel. [Chasing Void]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, Thorpe was issued with the standard Organization Titans.\n\n== Spells Utilized ==\n*Augerfrost\n*Boltflare\n*Raypulse\n*Hyperstride\n\n== Bonded Titans ==\n*Mindrone\n*Redcap\n*Strix\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nMs. Thorpe.png\nMs. Thorpe.jpg\nS1E02 Thorpe invokes Mindrone.png|Ms. Thorpe invokes Mindrone","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Ms._Thorpe.jpg\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Venice, Italy]]<br>[[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n| gender = Female\n| hair   = Red\n| eyes   = Brown\n| first  = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n|american=Karen Strassman}}\n'''Miss Thorpe''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[DeFoe]]. She is one of the group's operatives working out of [[Venice, Italy]].\n\n== History ==\nMiss Thorpe attacked [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] to retrieve the [[Eathon's journal]]. She invoked a [[Redcap]] but was defeated when Lok hit her on the head with a stick outside of [[Dante Vale's house]]. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nShe guarded the Organization safehouse on the [[Road of Alchemists]]. She was then, however, knocked out by [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]]. {{Source|Chasing Void}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, Thorpe was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}\n== Spells Utilized ==\n*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Boltflare]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n*[[Hyperstride]]\n\n{{Col-2}}\n== Bonded Titans ==\n*[[Mindrone]]\n*[[Redcap]]\n*[[Strix]]\n{{Col-end}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nMs. Thorpe.png\nMs. Thorpe.jpg\nS1E02 Thorpe invokes Mindrone.png|Ms. Thorpe invokes [[Mindrone]]\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"},{"target_title":"Prague, Czech Republic","label":"Prague, Czech Republic","target_id":"huntik:page:8072","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague%2C_Czech_Republic","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Prague%2C%20Czech%20Republic"},{"target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_id":"huntik:page:2257","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_id":"huntik:page:2048","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy",